{
  "name": "Kit: travel workflow",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "886a5885-cfff-40bf-8378-3ca8e037f6ea",
      "name": "Case in",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "kit-travel",
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "travel",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "notes": "Each case comes in here",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "id": "fa71279b-60e3-4c37-996a-68f2a3399859",
      "name": "Read the rules",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        260,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "{{KIT_TOOLS_URL}}/rules/travel/n8n/read_message.md",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "notes": "Reads the business rules: n8n/read_message.md",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "id": "8b75f22f-89e8-4cbf-bc75-8d3d5a17934d",
      "name": "Read message",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        560,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Today is {{ $('Case in').item.json.body.today }}.\n\nCase input:\n{{ JSON.stringify($('Case in').item.json.body.input) }}",
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "={{ $('Read the rules').item.json.text }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "notes": "AI: what, who, which days",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "id": "a1c63fc3-8bab-4c2e-9fe3-07723fb42b73",
      "name": "Read model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        560,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "{{KIT_MODEL}}"
        },
        "responsesApiEnabled": true,
        "options": {
          "timeout": 100000,
          "maxRetries": 1,
          "textFormat": {
            "textOptions": {
              "type": "json_schema",
              "name": "result",
              "schema": "={{ JSON.stringify({ ...$('Case in').item.json.body.output_schema, $schema: undefined, title: undefined }) }}"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "{{OPENAI_CREDENTIAL_ID}}",
          "name": "Kit OpenAI"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6978513d-b6a2-4cda-9db2-5a8874b0f131",
      "name": "Read result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        840,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "// The model answers JSON text, in the Response Format of its model node. Read it into `output`.\n// Also takes {\"output\": {...}} or a ```json block, so a good answer never stops the workflow.\nconst text = $json.text.trim().replace(/^```(?:json)?\\s*|\\s*```$/g, '');\nconst answer = JSON.parse(text);\nconst wrapped = answer.output && typeof answer.output === 'object' && Object.keys(answer).length === 1;\nreturn { json: { output: wrapped ? answer.output : answer } };"
      },
      "notes": "Reads the AI answer",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "id": "cfca911c-3459-480d-b98b-e6719c2f5172",
      "name": "Result out",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        1100,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.output) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "notes": "Sends it to the kit",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "id": "note-travel-in",
      "name": "Note: in",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -100,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 620,
        "height": 840,
        "content": "## 1 The message comes in\nWhen you run an eval, the kit sends each test email or Mattermost message (a **case**) to **Case in** (`input.email`, `input.message`). **Read the rules** gets the business rules file `usecases/travel/n8n/read_message.md` (kit UI → **Rules**) on every case: an edit there counts from the next case, no push.\n\n**See the data of one eval case:** kit results → the case → **n8n execution ↗** → double-click a node."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-travel-read",
      "name": "Note: read",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        520,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 540,
        "height": 840,
        "content": "## 2 Read message (AI)\n**The prompt** is the business rules file `n8n/read_message.md` (kit UI → **Rules**); the node gets it from **Read the rules**. One model call: kind, person, event, date.\n**Read model** > Options > Response Format forces the result shape of the case (`output.schema.json`): a schema change needs no edit here.\n**Read result** reads the answer. Change one thing, Publish, run the eval again."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-travel-out",
      "name": "Note: out",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1060,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 2,
        "width": 300,
        "height": 840,
        "content": "## Result out\nSends the result to the kit.\nA change of the graph here (a new node): **Publish** (top right); the eval saves it to `n8n/workflow.json`."
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Case in": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Read the rules",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Read the rules": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Read message",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Read message": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Read result",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Read result": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Result out",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Read model": {
      "ai_languageModel": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Read message",
            "type": "ai_languageModel",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "saveDataSuccessExecution": "all",
    "executionTimeout": 110,
    "binaryMode": "separate"
  }
}
